; Glamorous Toolkit entry point loading compiler sessions and artifact views.
; Views require gt4carp notebook runtime bindings and do not build standalone
; with reference Carp. `main.carp` is the compiler executable entry point.
;
; GT: (CarpProject onRoot: '<this repository>' entry: 'gt.carp') asBrowserTool

(load "carp-session/carp-session.carp")
(load "views/compiler.carp")
(load "views/session.carp")
